{
	"note": "kit-build's per-pack policy (roadmap 34 E2). categories: triangle budget of LOD0 (drawn, per node) and the largest bbox extent in metres. packs: textureCap (largest texture side), emissive ('none' = nothing in the pack may glow, 'allowed'), the default category and pivot, and per-item overrides. Pivots: bottom-center | bottom-center-back | top-center | wall-pivot (shares the wall's bottom-centre origin, starts above the floor) | wall-face (origin on the wall line, piece on the wall's face) | foot (stands on its origin, which is under the piece but not its middle: a signpost's post, a pipe's open end) | hinge (origin within 5 cm of the piece: a moving part) | any (legacy packs that keep their source scene's coordinates).",
